SMEM Allocated vs Configured²Compare per-CTA shared memory allocation against the configured (requested) size. If Configured >> Allocated, the driver-set SMEM partition is oversized for actual usage â€” reducing the shared-memory configuration may free space for L1 cache.
KB Configured shows the same value in kilobytes for reference.␀"“
