&Local Global Texture Surface BandwidthÎTrack how tagged-memory bandwidth flows through the cache hierarchy. Compare L1TEX Tag-Stage with L1TEX Misses, L2 Sectors, and L2 Misses to see amplification at each level.
If the miss ratio (L1TEX Misses / L1TEX Tag-Stage) is large, the L1 cache is ineffective â€” increase locality or check if the working set fits in L1.
If L2 Misses from L1TEX is large relative to L2 Sectors, the L2 cache is also being thrashed â€” the data set likely exceeds L2 capacity.␀"d
