%L1TEX LSU Throughput per Memory Space‘Identify which memory space drives high LSU throughput.
High LGDS wavefronts indicate heavy local/global/DMA traffic â€” break this down further in the Bandwidth per Memory Space row.
High Shared wavefronts indicate shared-memory traffic is a significant pipeline consumer."†
