L1TEX Cache Capacity per WarpúThe effective L1 cache capacity available to each resident warp. If L1 hit rates are low and this per-warp capacity is small, too many warps are sharing the L1 cache and thrashing each others data. Reducing occupancy (fewer warps, more cache per warp) or reducing the per-warp working set can improve hit rates â€” but only if the cache improvement outweighs the occupancy loss."Õ
