apmsampling:l1tex__data_bank_conflicts_pipe_lsu_mem_shared_op_st.avg.pct_of_peak_sustained_elapsedSMEM Bank Conflicts STJgb20x_TriageCompute_sampling"
cpmsampling:l1tex__data_bank_conflicts_pipe_lsu_mem_shared_op_atom.avg.pct_of_peak_sustained_elapsedSMEM Bank Conflicts AtomJgb20x_TriageCompute_sampling"¡
epmsampling:l1tex__data_bank_conflicts_pipe_lsu_mem_shared_op_ldgsts.avg.pct_of_peak_sustained_elapsedSMEM Bank Conflicts LDGSTSJgb20x_TriageCompute_sampling"Ã 
Shared Bank Conflict RatiosíAverage bank-conflict multiplier per shared-memory request (range: 1x = no conflicts, up to 32x = worst case). A ratio above ~2x indicates significant conflict overhead.
LD conflicts: rearrange load indexing so consecutive threads access different banks.
ST conflicts: pad shared arrays or restructure write patterns.
Atom conflicts: if ratio is high, shared-memory atomics are heavily serialized â€” use warp-level reductions (shuffle + single atomic) to lower the per-request conflict count."ý
STriageCompute.l1tex__average_data_bank_conflicts_per_request_mem_shared_op_ld.ratioSMEM Conflicts/Req LDJgb20x_TriageCompute_samplingz¡TriageCompute.l1data_bank_conflicts_to_l1tex_wavefronts_conversion_factor = ConversionFactorMetric(1.0, DimUnit.l1tex_wavefronts / DimUnit.l1data_bank_conflicts)zÔTriageCompute.l1tex__data_pipe_lsu_requests_mem_shared_op_ld = CounterMetric(l1tex__data_pipe_lsu_wavefronts_mem_shared_op_ld - l1tex__data_bank_conflicts_pipe_lsu_mem_shared_op_ld * TriageCompute.l1data_bank_conflicts_to_l1tex_wavefronts_conversion_factor) TriageCompute.l1tex__data_pipe_lsu_requests_mem_shared_op_ld:SetSustainedRate(1.0)zõTriageCompute.l1tex__average_data_bank_conflicts_per_request_mem_shared_op_ld = RatioMetric(l1tex__data_bank_conflicts_pipe_lsu_mem_shared_op_ld, RollupOp.avg, TriageCompute.l1tex__data_pipe_lsu_requests_mem_shared_op_ld, RollupOp.avg, 31.0, '')"ý
STriageCompute.l1tex__average_data_bank_conflicts_per_request_mem_shared_op_st.ratioSMEM Conflicts/Req STJgb20x_TriageCompute_samplingz¡TriageCompute.l1data_bank_conflicts_to_l1tex_wavefronts_conversion_factor = ConversionFactorMetric(1.0, DimUnit.l1tex_wavefronts / DimUnit.l1data_bank_conflicts)zÔTriageCompute.l1tex__data_pipe_lsu_requests_mem_shared_op_st = CounterMetric(l1tex__data_pipe_lsu_wavefronts_mem_shared_op_st - l1tex__data_bank_conflicts_pipe_lsu_mem_shared_op_st * TriageCompute.l1data_bank_conflicts_to_l1tex_wavefronts_conversion_factor) TriageCompute.l1tex__data_pipe_lsu_requests_mem_shared_op_st:SetSustainedRate(1.0)zõTriageCompute.l1tex__average_data_bank_conflicts_per_request_mem_shared_op_st = RatioMetric(l1tex__data_bank_conflicts_pipe_lsu_mem_shared_op_st, RollupOp.avg, TriageCompute.l1tex__data_pipe_lsu_requests_mem_shared_op_st, RollupOp.avg, 31.0, '')"
UTriageCompute.l1tex__average_data_bank_conflicts_per_request_mem_shared_op_atom.ratioSMEM Conflicts/Req AtomJgb20x_TriageCompute_samplingz¡TriageCompute.l1data_bank_conflicts_to_l1tex_wavefronts_conversion_factor = ConversionFactorMetric(1.0, DimUnit.l1tex_wavefronts / DimUnit.l1data_bank_conflicts)zÜTriageCompute.l1tex__data_pipe_lsu_requests_mem_shared_op_atom = CounterMetric(l1tex__data_pipe_lsu_wavefronts_mem_shared_op_atom - l1tex__data_bank_conflicts_pipe_lsu_mem_shared_op_atom * TriageCompute.l1data_bank_conflicts_to_l1tex_wavefronts_conversion_factor) TriageCompute.l1tex__data_pipe_lsu_requests_mem_shared_op_atom:SetSustainedRate(1.0)zûTriageCompute.l1tex__average_data_bank_conflicts_per_request_mem_shared_op_atom = RatioMetric(l1tex__data_bank_conflicts_pipe_lsu_mem_shared_op_atom, RollupOp.avg, TriageCompute.l1tex__data_pipe_lsu_requests_mem_shared_op_atom, RollupOp.avg, 31.0, '')"Ÿ
UTriageCompute.l1tex__average_data_bank_conflicts_per_request_mem_shared_op_ldgsts.pctSMEM Conflicts/Req LDGSTSJgb20x_TriageCompute_samplingz¡TriageCompute.l1data_bank_conflicts_to_l1tex_wavefronts_conversion_factor = ConversionFactorMetric(1.0, DimUnit.l1tex_wavefronts / DimUnit.l1data_bank_conflicts)zäTriageCompute.l1tex__data_pipe_lsu_requests_mem_shared_op_ldgsts = CounterMetric(l1tex__data_pipe_lsu_wavefronts_mem_shared_op_ldgsts - l1tex__data_bank_conflicts_pipe_lsu_mem_shared_op_ldgsts * TriageCompute.l1data_bank_conflicts_to_l1tex_wavefronts_conversion_factor) TriageCompute.l1tex__data_pipe_lsu_requests_mem_shared_op_ldgsts:SetSustainedRate(1.0)zTriageCompute.l1tex__average_data_bank_conflicts_per_request_mem_shared_op_ldgsts = RatioMetric(l1tex__data_bank_conflicts_pipe_lsu_mem_shared_op_ldgsts, RollupOp.avg, TriageCompute.l1tex__data_pipe_lsu_requests_mem_shared_op_ldgsts, RollupOp.avg, 31.0, '')"·
$Shared Memory Requests per OperationôPer-operation request counts entering the shared-memory pipeline. Use alongside Shared Memory Imputed Bandwidth to see request volume rather than wavefront count.
If LD or ST requests are much higher than expected from the algorithm, redundant shared-memory accesses may be present â€” check whether multiple warps re-read the same shared tile.
If Atom requests are significant, consider replacing shared-memory atomics with warp-level shuffle reductions followed by a single shared write.
If LDGSTS requests are present, the kernel uses cp.async â€” verify that the staging pattern matches tile sizes to avoid wasted bandwidth.␀"ú
