SM Register OccupancyÙCheck whether registers are the occupancy limiter. If Register Occupancy is near 100% while Warps Inactive (SM Active) is high, too many registers per thread prevent additional warps from being resident. Avg Registers/Thread shows the current usage â€” reducing it (via compiler flags or algorithmic changes) allows more warps to fit on each SM."’
