%GCC Tag-Stage Miss-Bandwidth per Type±GCC miss traffic flowing to L2, per request type. This shows tag-stage misses (some may still hit in the GCC data stage).
If one type dominates the miss bandwidth, it is the primary contributor to GCC-originated L2 pressure â€” focus on reducing that types footprint using the guidance from GCC Hit Rates.␀"€
