,L2 Atomic Sectors per Operation (from L1TEX)¼Total atomic sector volume arriving at L2 from the SM. Compare with L2 Atomic Hit in the row above to compute the atomic miss rate. If this row is significant and hit rate is low, atomics are serializing at DRAM â€” consider warp-level reductions, privatization, or hierarchical aggregation to reduce atomic traffic."Ö
