Executed IPCùCompare IPC against active cycles vs elapsed cycles. A large gap between Active and Elapsed IPC means the SM spends significant time idle.
If Active IPC itself is low (well under 1.0), warps are stalling frequently â€” see Warp Stall Reasons for the dominant stall class.
If Active IPC is healthy but Elapsed IPC is low, the problem is GPU utilization, not per-warp efficiency."o
