Blocks ActiveThe live count of CTAs occupying SM block slots. If Average Blocks Active is low relative to the hardware maximum (24 per SM), the workload is underfilled or blocks are too resource-heavy. Compare with SM Register Occupancy and Per-CTA Resource Usage to identify the limiting resource."q
