*pmsampling:l1tex__t_sectors.sum.per_secondL1TEX Tag-Stage SectorsJgr10x_TriageCompute_sampling"ä
Local Global BandwidthòTrack how tagged-memory bandwidth flows through the cache hierarchy. Compare L1TEX Tag-Stage with L1TEX Misses, L2 Sectors, and L2 Misses to see amplification at each level.
If the miss ratio (L1TEX Misses / L1TEX Tag-Stage) is large, the L1 cache is ineffective â€” increase locality or check if the working set fits in L1 (see L1TEX Cache Capacity per Warp).
If L2 Misses from L1TEX is large relative to L2 Sectors, the L2 cache is also being thrashed â€” the data set likely exceeds L2 capacity.␀"c
