If LSU Data-Stage or TC Data-Stage is the peak, the pipeline is address/data-processing limited â€” drill into the per-space rows below to find the dominant memory type.
If L1-to-XBAR Requests is high, L1 misses are generating heavy off-chip traffic â€” check L1TEX Sector Hit Rate for cache efficiency."Ý
