0pmsampling:dram__sectors_op_write.sum.per_secondDRAM Write BandwidthJgb20x_TriageCompute_sampling*¯
DRAM Throughput­Compare throughput at L2 Request, L2 Miss, and DRAM stages to understand the amplification from L2 to DRAM. If DRAM Sectors is close to L2 Request Bandwidth, the L2 cache is ineffective â€” most requests reach DRAM.
If DRAM Sectors is near its %-of-peak ceiling, the workload is DRAM-bandwidth limited â€” check L2 Bandwidth per Source Unit to find the dominant consumer, and DRAM Read-to-Write Turns for protocol-level overhead."h
