SMEM Allocated‹Shows how much of the shared-memory partition is actually used by resident CTAs. A large Shared Unallocated region suggests the shared-memory configuration is oversized for actual usage â€” the driver-configured SMEM size may be reducible, freeing space for L1 cache.␀"ã
