If LD + ST + Atom wavefronts are much higher than expected from SM-level shared instructions, bank conflicts are generating replay wavefronts â€” check Shared Bank Conflict Ratios for per-op conflict rates.
High LDGSTS wavefronts indicate asynchronous copy (cp.async) staging through shared memory.␀"€
