PAggregate Pipe Utilization (% of peak instructions executed over elapsed cycles)"
Utilization [%]d*C
<sm__inst_executed_pipe_alu.avg.pct_of_peak_sustained_elapsedALU*C
<sm__inst_executed_pipe_fma.avg.pct_of_peak_sustained_elapsedFMA08@JŸAggregate pipeline utilization based on the number of executed instructions over elapsed (all) cycles. This does not account for any variation in instruction latencies for this pipeline. For an instruction requiring 4 cycles to complete execution, the counter is increased by 1 only. Use this to understand the composition of instructions/latencies (high-latency, low-rate instructions won't result in peak values).
