If misses dominate hits, most accesses are paying full L2/DRAM latency â€” focus on improving spatial locality, tiling, or prefetching.
If hits dominate, the L1 cache is working well â€” any remaining throughput issue is likely in the data-stage pipeline, not cache misses.␀"h
