L2 Throughput per Source Unit–Identify which unit is driving L2 traffic. The dominant bar is the primary L2 consumer.
L1TEX dominates (typical): SM load/store/texture misses are the primary L2 consumer â€” optimize L1 hit rates.
GCC is significant: constant or instruction cache pressure is spilling to L2 â€” check Constant & Instruction Caches group.
FBP/GPC is significant: frame buffer or GPC-side traffic is consuming L2 bandwidth."Œ
