"L2 Hits per Operation (from L1TEX)ËPer-operation hit sector counts at L2, for traffic originating from the SM (L1TEX). Shows how many sectors were served by L2 without going to DRAM.
Compare Read/Write/Atomic hits with the total L1TEX sectors in L2 Bandwidth per Source Unit to estimate the per-operation miss rate.
If Atomic Hit is small relative to atomics shown in L2 Atomic Sectors per Operation, most atomics fall through to DRAM â€” use warp-level pre-aggregation to improve L2 hit rates.␀"á
STriageCompute.lts__t_sectors_srcunit_tex_op_read_lookup_hit_realtime.sum.per_secondL2 Read Hit (from L1TEX)Jgb20x_TriageCompute_samplingzÑTriageCompute.lts__t_sectors_srcunit_tex_op_read_lookup_hit_realtime = CounterMetric(lts__t_sectors_srcunit_tex_op_read_realtime - lts__t_sectors_srcunit_tex_op_read_lookup_miss_realtime, '# of LTS sectors from unit L1TEX for all reads that hit') TriageCompute.lts__t_sectors_srcunit_tex_op_read_lookup_hit_realtime:SetSustainedRate(2.0)"è
