SysL2 Hit MissµSysL2 cache effectiveness. If misses dominate, SysL2 is not caching system-memory data effectively â€” every miss pays full PCIe/NVLink latency.
High miss rate is expected for streaming transfers but problematic for random access to pinned memory. If possible, copy data to device memory before kernel launch."„
