Clock Frequencies␀*È
Clock Frequencies—Monitor GPU clock domains over time. Frequency drops during profiling indicate thermal throttling, power capping, or driver clock management.
For consistent profiling, lock clocks before measurement. Nsight Compute typically locks the GPC clock, but other domains may still vary."\
